cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DiGiTerra, cite this software.
title: >-
  DiGiTerra: Tabular Machine Learning in the Browser with scikit-learn
abstract: >-
  DiGiTerra is a Flask application for exploring a tabular dataset, training a
  scikit-learn model on the dataset, and running inference on new rows. The
  application offers 67 trainable estimators (32 regression, 23 classification, 12 clustering) across regression,
  classification, and clustering, with optional feature selection, outlier
  handling, hyperparameter search, and cross-validation, and ships as a desktop
  application for macOS, Windows, and Linux.
type: software
